<html><head><title>Sustainable impact</title>
<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">One of the goals of transdisciplinary projects is to </span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">create impact through collaboration</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">.</span><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">Thanks</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">rich</span><span style="margin: 0px"> cooperation </span><span style="margin: 0px">between</span><span style="margin: 0px"> different </span><span style="margin: 0px">parties</span><span style="margin: 0px">, </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">outcome</span><span style="margin: 0px"> has a </span><span style="margin: 0px">greater</span><span style="margin: 0px"> chance of </span><span style="margin: 0px">being</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">effective</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">However</span><span style="margin: 0px">, change </span><span style="margin: 0px">doesn’t</span><span style="margin: 0px"> happen </span><span style="margin: 0px">overnight</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">You</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">can</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">read</span><span style="margin: 0px"> more </span><span style="margin: 0px">about</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">achieving</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">and</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">ensuring</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold"><span style="margin: 0px">long-term, </span><span style="margin: 0px">sustainable</span><span style="margin: 0px"> impact</span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px"> on </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold"><span style="margin: 0px">theory</span><span style="margin: 0px"> page</span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">Check </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;"><span style="margin: 0px">practice</span><span style="margin: 0px"> page</span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">for</span><span style="margin: 0px"> approaches </span><span style="margin: 0px">used</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">by</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">others</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div></body></html>